// Every string Solid Eleven shows (issue #59: the engine's string tables).
// The game reads them as static code: after an edit, export and check —
//   in the engine:  cargo xtask i18n export --rust examples/solid-eleven/src/ui/strings_gen.rs --dir examples/solid-eleven
//                   cargo xtask i18n check --dir examples/solid-eleven
//   in a project from the football template:
//                   cargo trino i18n export --rust game/src/ui/strings_gen.rs
//                   cargo trino i18n check
